<title>UK: BG Berlin sets 10 billion escudo 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>BG Berlin sets 10 billion escudo 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Essi and Banco Mello Investments.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTE    COUPON     6.80	MATURITY   *20.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 100	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p>MOODY/IBCA AA1/AAA  NOTES     *CALLABLE ON PAR ON 28.FEB.98.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
